HAI 1.4

OBTW
Galaxy story text maps deterministic omen values and relic progress to pure
display YARNs. ENCOUNTER and MISSIONTEXT neither mutate state nor print, so
Views.lol may safely use them during retained screen composition. The module
has no imports, initialization, or source-order assumptions; direct functions
are hoisted project-wide.
TLDR

BTW ENCOUNTER maps a deterministic omen to a short event description.
HOW IZ I ENCOUNTER YR omen
  omen
  WTF?
    OMG 0
      FOUND YR "QUIET STARS. TEH RADIO PURRZ."
    OMG 1
      FOUND YR "A PIRATE CAT DEMANDZ A SNACK."
    OMGWTF
      FOUND YR "AN ANCIENT PROBE BLINKZ IN BINARY."
  OIC
IF U SAY SO

BTW MISSIONTEXT reports the story goal from the current relic flag.
HOW IZ I MISSIONTEXT YR game
  BOTH SAEM game'Z player'Z relic AN 0
  O RLY?
    YA RLY
      FOUND YR "MISSION:: FIND TEH STARFISH RELIC IN SECTOR 3."
    NO WAI
      FOUND YR "MISSION COMPLETE:: TEH GALAXY REMEMBERS UR NAME."
  OIC
IF U SAY SO

KTHXBYE
